053400* --- 5000-CLOSE-RESERVE: CLOSE THE CASE RESERVES
053500 5000-CLOSE-RESERVE.
053600* FINAL SETTLEMENT: CLOSE EVERY OPEN RESERVE ON THE CLAIM
053700*   (BR-RSV-014).
053800* THE OUTSTANDING AMOUNT BEFORE CLOSE IS RETURNED BY OLD TABLE AND
053900* POSTED AS A NEGATIVE ST MOVEMENT.
054000     PERFORM VARYING WS-RSV-TYPE-IX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL
054100         WS-RSV-TYPE-IX > 3
054200        MOVE WS-RSV-TYPE(WS-RSV-TYPE-IX) TO WS-CLOSE-TYPE
054300        EXEC SQL
054400            SELECT RSV_ID, RSV_OUTSTANDING_AMT
054500              INTO :RSV-RSV-ID, :WS-OLD-OUTSTANDING
054600              FROM OLD TABLE (
054700            UPDATE CLR.T_RESERVE SET RSV_OUTSTANDING_AMT = 0,
054800                   RSV_STATUS = 'C',
054900                   LAST_UPD_TS = CURRENT TIMESTAMP,
055000                   LAST_UPD_PGM = :WS-PGM-ID,
055100                   LAST_UPD_USER = :WS-USER-ID
055200             WHERE CLAIM_ID = :PAYR-CLAIM-ID
055300               AND RSV_TYPE_CD = :WS-CLOSE-TYPE
055400               AND RSV_STATUS = 'O' )
055500        END-EXEC
055600        EVALUATE SQLCODE
055700           WHEN 0
055800              ADD 1 TO WS-RESERVE-WRITTEN
055900              COMPUTE WS-OLD-OUTSTANDING = 0 - WS-OLD-OUTSTANDING
056000              PERFORM 5100-POST-CLOSE-MOVEMENT
056100           WHEN +100
056200              CONTINUE
056300           WHEN OTHER
056400              MOVE '5000-CLOSE-RESERVE' TO ERR-PARA
056500              PERFORM 8000-SQL-ERROR
056600        END-EVALUATE
056700     END-PERFORM
